{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "637d00e4-ab63-4fe3-8e63-1e206c728841"/*CustomSDF*/,
  "Description": "Creates an SDF from a short HLSL code fragment.\n\nDistanceFunction is the body of a function: `p` is the sample position (float3), and the code must return the signed distance to the surface. Offset, A, B and C are available as parameters, and a GLSL-style mod() is predefined. The default code generates a sphere; the presets contain many fractal examples.\n\nRender the result with [RaymarchField] and inspect it with [VisualizeFieldDistance]. Modify it with [TransformField], [BendField], [RepeatPolar] and other field operators.\n\nSee also: [FractalSDF], [BoxSDF]\n\nFull documentation: https://help.tixl.app/advanced/UsingCustomShaders/",
  "SymbolTags": "1",
  "InputUis": [
    {
      "InputId": "3c366d34-c398-410e-972b-d8cc2baffddb"/*A*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 0.0
      },
      "Description": "Generic parameter available as A in the code.",
      "AddPadding": "True",
      "Min": -1.0,
      "Max": 1.0,
      "Scale": 0.001
    },
    {
      "InputId": "48a0699d-1207-4e18-ab9b-4da7f77cc7aa"/*AdditionalDefines*/,
      "Position": {
        "X": -200.0,
        "Y": 225.0
      },
      "Description": "Optional HLSL code inserted before the function, e.g. for helper functions or #defines.",
      "Usage": "Multiline"
    },
    {
      "InputId": "56e5d5ec-ec59-4ea0-85c1-1eca3dcb5790"/*C*/,
      "Position": {
